<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Sun Globe</h1>
<p>Sphere: Creation Sphere
Spell Tier: 2
Class: Conjurer (guild level 18), Sorcerer (guild level 25)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre><a cmd='#'>cast sun globe</a>
</pre>
<p>Creates a bright yellow globe of light out of your mana. Hold it (see 
<a cmd='#'>Help Hold</a>) to light up dark places. It is as bright as a magic candle, but 
it doesn't burn out: it lasts until you drop it or it is lost.
</p><p>You must be standing. The spell is also found on staffs, scrolls and wands. 
For darkness instead, see <a cmd='#'>Help Night Globe</a>.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Magic Candle</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Night Globe</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Light</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Creation Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>